  <div class="dashboard-body">
    <div class="dash-col">
      <p>  <p>Returns a list that is the bounding box of <b>object</b> relative to its root prim, in <a href="https://wiki.secondlife.com/wiki/Viewer_coordinate_frames#local" target="_blank">local coordinates</a>.</p>
  <p>Format: `[ (vector) min_corner, (vector) max_corner ]`</p>
</p>
      <table class="param-table" id="parameters">
        <tr>
          <td><span class="lua-section"><span class="tag lua-tag">Lua</span>uuid</span></td>
